  "details": "1. Open VRChat on PC.\n\n2. Change your \"Appearing As\" setting from `Trusted User` to `User`.\n\n3. Log Out.\n\n4. Log In to VRChat on Android Mobile, iOS Mobile, or Quest.\n\n5. Your \"Appearing As\" setting will instead be `Trusted User`, even though you previously set it to `User`.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\n\nThe \"Appearing As\" setting should sync cross-platform with your Account via the VRChat API.\n\n**How to Debug?**\n\nLook at VRCX and watch if it records your Rank being changed from the usage of the \"Appearing As\" setting.",
